Activity 1 - Stakeholder Map

Stakeholder 
Patient 

Need 
To easily book appointments and be flexible with the times  

Conflict 
A patient may want easy and flexible booking time while a practitioner wants more of a fixed,structured and controlled schedule which conflicts with the patients as their would want an appointment that doesn’t give impact to their day as they may want appointment times where the  Practitioner is unavailable  


Stakeholder
Practitioner

Need 
To see patients previous appointment history 

Conflict 
Practitioners would want longer appointments with the patient to understand every important of the patient for the appointment but clinic management would want shorter times for more output of appointments     


Stakeholder
Receptionist 

Need 
Ways to quickly search up patients with speed,accuracy

Conflict 
Receptionist would want simple and easy workflows however Clinic management  would want very detailed records of patients which will slow down the Receptionist’s work speed   


Stakeholder
Clinic management 

Need 
Consistent reporting and management of the system  

Conflict 
Clinic management would want a lot of appointments a day which can make Practitioner feel rush or overloaded with work overload 






